# Carrier: the walker that takes wood and stone over the road (StructureSystem::tickCarriers moves it: no
# physics body, no unit sim). Global: the game writes its position, and only an entity the pass visits shows it.
# Spawned with its feet on the road.
# SHAPE (a placeholder; uniform scales): a tunic (the root), a head, and the LOAD it holds in FRONT of its body
# (-Z: an entity's forward is -Z). The load is the SECOND child: tickCarriers shows it only while the walker
# carries one on foot. The children after it are the CART of a transport trip (see below).
# CullMode RootOnly: the root culls for the head and the load. With an entry of its own, a load that was hidden when
# the walker left its house would keep that entry at the house, and the pass would not visit it when it is shown.
Prefab gameCarrier
	Global true
	CullMode RootOnly
	Component Render
		ObjectContainer baseshapes
		Node Pillar2
		Type StaticMesh
		Color 0.45 0.33 0.2
		Position 0 0.5 0
		Scale 0.22
	Component Scene
		Entity
			Name Head
			Position 0 1.1 0
			Component Render
				ObjectContainer baseshapes
				Node Sphere
				Type StaticMesh
				Color 0.85 0.68 0.5
				Scale 0.17
		Entity
			Name Pack
			Position 0 0.62 -0.34
			Component Render
				ObjectContainer baseshapes
				Node Cube
				Type StaticMesh
				Color 0.6 0.5 0.3
				Scale 0.2
		# THE CART (a transport trip between two stores): pulled BEHIND the walker (+Z). CartLoad is the THIRD child
		# (shown only while the cart is full); every child after it is the cart itself.
		Entity
			Name CartLoad
			Position 0 0.72 0.95
			Component Render
				ObjectContainer baseshapes
				Node Cube
				Type StaticMesh
				Color 0.6 0.5 0.3
				Scale 0.26
		Entity
			Name CartBed
			Position 0 0.38 0.95
			Component Render
				ObjectContainer baseshapes
				Node CubeQuarter
				Type StaticMesh
				Color 0.4 0.28 0.16
				Scale 0.36
		Entity
			Name CartWheelL
			Position -0.42 0.2 0.95
			Component Render
				ObjectContainer baseshapes
				Node Sphere
				Type StaticMesh
				Color 0.22 0.16 0.1
				Scale 0.2
		Entity
			Name CartWheelR
			Position 0.42 0.2 0.95
			Component Render
				ObjectContainer baseshapes
				Node Sphere
				Type StaticMesh
				Color 0.22 0.16 0.1
				Scale 0.2
		Entity
			Name CartPole
			Position 0 0.4 0.38
			Component Render
				ObjectContainer baseshapes
				Node Pillar3
				Type StaticMesh
				Color 0.4 0.28 0.16
				Rotation 90 0 0
				Scale 0.06
